# DEKOPEN — Codex repository rules

Use `AGENTS.md` as the entry map and `docs/AGENT_OPERATING_MODEL.md` for non-normative
execution guidance. The only product/system authority is `docs/CONSTITUTION.md`, followed by
the active PRDs and `docs/PRD/PLAN_SHOTS.md`.

Preserve Decimal-only dimensions and money, pure deterministic `/engine`, 0.00 mm tolerance,
strict RLS, pre-write audit, idempotent payments, semantic CSS tokens and read-only Golden.

Choose checks by the proof surface changed. A full `python scripts/check_dod.py all` is required
for the final material implementation head of a SHOT; it is not an automatic stop condition for
every documentation-only or contained follow-up change. Protected CI is the independent
integration verdict.

Stop for a material contradiction, a material gap marked `[PENDIENTE-DECISIÓN]`, or an
unauthorized irreversible action. Do not weaken checkers, tests, Golden or branch protection.
